Two gaps remain. The pull loop can skip verification of an arrived directory when the retrieval deadline expires. The driver also treats an ordinary cell exception as worker loss and can trigger a paid restart. Read-only probes confirmed both cases. The analysis code is unchanged. The 7 USD cap remains an admission limit; the watchdog bound is 9.10 USD.

